{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22255","headline":"宿清源寺 · 白居易","name":"宿清源寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往谪浔阳去，夜憩辋溪曲。\n今爲钱塘行，重经兹寺宿。\n尔来几何岁，溪草二八绿。\n不见旧房僧，苍然新树木。\n虚空走日月，世界迁陵谷。\n我生寄其间，孰能逃倚伏。\n随缘又南去，好住东廊竹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}